window.products.push({"id":827023,"name":"Melitta MES1R OneOne Single Serve Coffeemaker, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YJB2VNEHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description With a bold look as modern as its technology, the Melitta One:One Java Pod Coffeemaker in red is what today's coffee lovers have been wishing for. In less than one minute, the One:One brews a single perfect portion of coffee directly into your waiting cup. This streamlined machine requires no filters or ground coffee, so there's no measuring and no mess. One:One uses a revolutionary Java Pod system to deliver 3 mug-sized servings of hot coffee for each brewing cycle. Simply drop in a pre-portioned Java Pod filled with aromatic coffee, and push a button to select a 5-oz. European-style or a smoother 8-oz. American-style cup. Includes 1 each of 6 Java Pods: Buzzworthy, French Kisses, Go Hazelnuts, Skip the Buzz, Love at First Sip and Café Kind of Day. Additional Java Pods sold separately. Imported. From the Manufacturer Skip those expensive coffee bars. This one:one coffee maker gives you more time to do the things you love. Leave your slippers on. Read the whole paper instead of just the headlines. Catch your favorite morning show. All the while sipping an exquisite coffee beverage, handmade by you, in less than one minute. Simplicity, speed, and a perfect cup of coffee every time. You should never have to think before that first cup of coffee. That's why we created the one:one coffee maker. Forget the filters. Forget the measuring and the mess. Just drop our specially made java-pod into the machine, and you'll have a perfect mug of rich, aromatic coffee in less than a minute. Simple as that. The one:one coffee maker brews directly into your mug, one customized cup at a time. Your coffee is always fresh, never scorched. It's the ultimate cup of coffee every time. And its definitely not your dad's coffee maker. Features: Freedom to choose different blends or flavors for each cup you brew Freedom to choose different blends or flavors for each cup you brew Large water tank makes three mug-size servings before refilling is needed Large water tank makes three mug-size servings before refilling is needed Choice of a 5-oz. bold European style coffee or an 8-oz. American style at the touch of a button Choice of a 5-oz. bold European style coffee or an 8-oz. American style at the touch of a button","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41YJB2VNEHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melitta","source_asin":"B0000DEZNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DEZNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DEZNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":827024,"name":"Acacia Wood Serving Tray with 3 Ceramic Bowls & 3 Wooden Spoons - Relish Tray with Stainless Steel Handles & Non-Scratch Rubber Feet Serves as Chip an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cvvpm7c+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set a Stunning Table: Wow your guests and show off your hosting skills with this gorgeous appetizer serving tray; Friends and family alike will appreciate the natural beauty of the solid wood serving board, the simple elegance of the 3 charcuterie bowls, and the convenience of the sleek wooden serving spoons Heirloom-Quality Craftsmanship: You’ll count on this chips and dip serving dish for many years to come; Unlike flimsier wooden serving trays, it’s crafted of finest acacia wood, known for its rich grain, superior strength, and natural moisture resistance; Plus, it has sturdy stainless steel handles and anti-scratch rubber “feet” Custom-Size Spoons Simplify Serving and Noshing: Unlike most serving trays for entertaining, this one comes with matching wood serving spoons for parties; That way, your guests can easily scoop their own sauces, dips, etc.; Plus, you’ll never have to rummage in your utensil drawer for just the right spoon to use with each chip and dip bowl You’ll Find Endless Ways to Use Our 3 Small Bowls for Charcuterie Board: Load up these ceramic dipping sauce bowls with everything from sauce to nuts; Try them as condiment bowls and soy sauce bowls; Use one as a salsa bowl, another as a veggie tray serving dish, and so on; Fill them with fruits, jams, jellies, berries, candies, and more Guaranteed to Elevate Your Entertaining Experience: I’m always looking for ways to bring more warmth, joy, and beauty to every home; That’s why I developed this wooden serving tray (12.75” x 4.75”) with 3 white ceramic bowls (3.5/8” x 1.5” each) and 3 acacia wood spoons; Not thrilled? Simply return your set for a full money-back refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cvvpm7c+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUGOODS","source_asin":"B09VK36M36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VK36M36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VK36M36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":827025,"name":"ELONG HOME Solid Wooden Hangers 30 Pack, Slim Wood Coat Hangers with Extra Smooth Finish, Precisely Cut Notches and Chrome Swivel Hook, Wooden Clothes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gYk3ozQOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DURABLE WOOD: Crafted with natural birch wood, the pack of 30 smooth finished heavy duty wood hangers. Strong in construction to hang heavy winter garments like coats, suits, and jackets. The dimensions: 17\"(L) x 8.3\"(H) x 0.4\"(W). SMOOTH POLISH SURFACE: Use eco-friendly glossy lacquering, snag-free to protect your valued garments. Double hand-sanding smooth wooden shirt hangers notches protect your delicate clothes from snagging. CONVENIENT 360 DEGREE SWIVEL HOOK & NOTCHES: Designed with beautiful 360-degree swivel chrome anti-rust hook, you can hang and take clothes at any angle. Two notches on the both side shoulders can keep your strappy clothes in one place without slipping. SPACE SAVING HANGERS: The thickness of Elong Home wooden coat hangers is 2/5\".They are thinner than other wood coat hangers but also sturdy and durable to hang heavier winter clothes like jackets or coats. Ultra thin design maximizes the storage space and fully utilizes your closet to avoid clutter. WHAT YOU GET: Valued set of 30 pack slim wooden hanger closet. Packaged by hard carton to prevent wooden blouse hangers breaking! Friendly customer service and if for any problem about our natural wooden closet hangers please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gYk3ozQOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELONG HOME","source_asin":"B087WM6RHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087WM6RHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087WM6RHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":827026,"name":"Friedr. Dick 1905 Exclusive Series 8-Inch Chef's Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BRJHotOpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Harkening back to the unique design that the Friedr. Dick company debuted in 1905, this distinctively styled 8-inch chef's knife from the Friedr. Dick 1905 Exclusive Series replaces the common rivets that mount the handle to the steel of the knife with a trio of metal rings. The symmetrical steel rings are inseparably connected to the molded plastic handle, using unique modern manufacturing processes, and it also complies with current high hygiene standards. Made from high-quality German XCrMoVMn stainless steel--preferred by professional chefs--the blade is well sharpened and the knife enjoys perfect equilibrium, tapering at the tip. A finely dispersed martensitic structure is produced (starting with a hardness of over 60 HRc) thanks to a high-tech tempering process at temperatures of approximately 1950 degrees F and cryogenic treatment at temperatures as low as -310 degrees F. Targeted tempering in several stages at approx 392 degrees F carefully reduces hardness to 55HRc, which guarantees sharpness and retention of edge. Manufactured in Germany, every Friedr. Dick finished knife is sharpened and honed by hand--just as it's been done since the company's founding in 1778 by Johann Friedrich Dick--and each knife is given the unmistakable Friedr. Dick etching. While this Friedr. Dick knife is dishwasher safe, it's recommended that you hand wash it using a mild dishwashing soap; rinse with water and dry thoroughly with a towel. Backed by a lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BRJHotOpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Friedr Dick","source_asin":"B00332EQQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00332EQQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00332EQQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
