window.products.push({"id":827038,"name":"Loomie Shoe Cabinet, Free Standing Tipping Bucket Shoe Rack Organizer with 2 Flip Drawers,Entryway Narrow Shoe Storage with Storage Shelf & Top Cubby,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZVo-ew+UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👞【Perfect Shoe Storage Solution】No more shoes all over the floor or unsightly wire shelf unit, the Loomie hidden shoe cabinet with doors have two deep flip drawers, each with room for two rows of shoes. This means that you can hide away at least sixteen pairs of shoes inside them, which helping you organize your shoes and saveing floor space at the same time. And get a neat and organized hallway in the bargain. 👠【Ample Storage Space】Loomie shoe storage cabinet has two flip drawers and 2 tiers inside each drawer. The compartment in the middle of each flip drawer can be removed or adjusted to fit different shoe heights. The spacious top surface and open top cubby are perfect for accessories, keys, wallet and etc and make you easier to access items. Besides, the extra added open gold shoe rack of the botton further increases storage capacity. Loomie shoe organizer can store more than 16 pairs of shoes. 👢【Why Loomie Shoe Cabinet】Combine functionality and on-trend design with this eye-catching and versatile shoe cabinet. The gold legs, gold metal handles and unique design pattern update any storage space, pairing perfectly with your modern or mid-century home space. Its compact footprint makes this the perfect storage space if you’re living with a tight, narrow or smaller space. It is exactly what you needed to clean up entryway, and what you wanted aesthetically. Its size and minimalist design make it a possibility for all sorts of spaces. Narrow Hallway, Corridor, Living room, Bedroom or Entryway... You're spoilt for choice! 👠【High-caliber Quality & Sturdy Construction】This Loomie shoe cabinet is made from durable commercial grade laminate and metal frame that will withstand all the daily stress that is thrown at it through the years, ensuring a consistent chic, minimalist look. Loomie shoe organizer is a safe purchase when it comes to quality. Anti-tipping kits and adjustable non-slip leg pads improve the stability. You don't worry about it falling by accident. Overall, it will get the shoe storaging job done and look good doing it. It's a perfect size shoe cabinet for every home space. 👟【Easy to Assemble, Clear Instruction】All parts and accessories are numbered, and each step of the installation has detailed instructions, easy to understand and to assemble. In addition, if you have any product problems, please contact us in time, all problems will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZVo-ew+UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loomie","source_asin":"B0BT4XQ3W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT4XQ3W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT4XQ3W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
