window.products.push({"id":827202,"name":"Ornativity Christmas Woman Skier Nutcracker – Red and White Wooden Nutcracker Woman with Ugly Sweater and Ski Sticks in Skiing Pose Xmas Themed Holida","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WIi7vWLvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ornativity Skier Nutcrackers are the ideal decorative figures for an Xmas themed Holiday party. The nutcracker is 15\" tall and stands prominently on the windowsill, mantel, or kitchen table. There's nothing that shows Christmas time is here like a nutcracker displayed one the dining table. The nutcracker has a functional wooden lever and makes for a great home decoration for Christmas. Ornativity manufacturers their items with care and quality to enhance your Christmas Experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WIi7vWLvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ornativity","source_asin":"B09Q7G84GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q7G84GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q7G84GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":827203,"name":"AeraVida Tropical Flower Black and Red Mango Tree Wood Balancing Wine Bottle Holder | Wooden Wine Bottle Holder | Flower Wooden Bottle Holder | Wood W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BXvwhy-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A graceful arch made from mango wood that is designed to hold a bottle of wine describes the elegant piece from artisan Thanet of Thailand. The balancing wine bottle is sure to add a dramatic touch to your table setting. A floral-inspired carving showcases the artisan's woodworking skill while giving this piece a beautiful handcrafted quality. Both functional and very stylish, this ornate piece of home décor is a great way to hold and display a bottle of wine. PLEASE NOTE: The handcrafted nature of this product will produce minor differences in design, sizing and weight. Variations will occur from piece to piece, measurements may vary slightly. Packaged in AERAVIDA branded environmentally sustainable packaging. AERAVIDA works directly with gifted and talented Artisans from all over the world. At the core of our philosophy is fair trade and fostering a sustainable future for our Artisans. ARTISAN STORY: Thanat has been drawing inspiration from the rich cultural heritage of his homeland to express his artistic talents for nearly ten years. He has a small workshop in Northern Thailand, where he and other family members practice their craftsmanship. At his workshop, only manual tools are used which helps achieve finely detailed work and artistry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BXvwhy-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AeraVida","source_asin":"B07VTMFKSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VTMFKSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VTMFKSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
