window.products.push({"id":827259,"name":"Ofuzzi Day - H8 Apex Cordless Handheld Vacuum Cleaner, 30AW Powerful Suction, 1.2lbs Lightweight, 120ml Dust Cup, Dual Filtration, 30 Mins Runtime, Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618YwuAHpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ofuzzi 2nd Anniversary Celebration, ONLY ONCE in 2023. Ultra-Lightweight - This handheld vacuum cleaner weighs only 1.2lbs (540g), you can clean easily using one hand. The lock on the dust canister prevents accidental opening, but you can empty it in seconds after you're done cleaning, and you can also remove the dust cup and filter for cleaning Powerful Suction - The M1 brushless motor delivers a surging 30AW(12kPa) of suction, efficiently sucking up even the most stubborn dust and fluff. This handheld vacuum cleaner has two power levels, which are available for different cleaning needs and the battery supports up to 30 minutes of use. ❗We recommend that you fully charge the device before using it for the first time Handy Accessories - Switch between four different accessories to get the most effective cleaning. Includes a crevice nozzle for narrow spaces, two for surfaces like sofas (great for removing pet hair), and one for general use. Crevice nozzle can be used with other accessories Dual-Layer Filtration System - The handheld vacuum cleaner has stainless steel filter and HEPA filter, which are washable and reusable, and the combination can filters out 99.95% of particles (Please assemble and use after the filter is completely dry). The 120ml dust canister is large enough to last for a whole clean ❗We have replaceable filters available for purchase Easy Storage - This handheld vacuum cleaner is fully charged in 3-4 hours by using the USB-C port. Comes with a handy storage bag, which you can use to neatly store the vacuum and its accessories away in a drawer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618YwuAHpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ofuzzi","source_asin":"B0BKZ34DJN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZ34DJN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZ34DJN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
