window.products.push({"id":827285,"name":"MARTISAN HL-8001 Steam Iron, 1800W Super Hot Ceramic Soleplate Iron, Anti-Drip, Anti-Calc, Self-Clean Function (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iW5-lfUgL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Ceramic Soleplate: Our durable ceramic soleplate glides well on any ironable garment. It's ceramic, scratch resistant and simple to keep clean. Anti-Drip Function: There is an assembly inside the iron which closes the steam vents when the temperature of the iron’s soleplate becomes very low, preventing water leakage. Anti-Calc Function: A special resin filter inside the water tank softens the water and prevents calc buildup in the soleplate. The resin filter is permanent and doesn’t need to be re-placed. Self-Cleaning Function: The self-cleaning removes calcium deposits to maintain high performance and increase the iron’s lifespan, which we recommend using this function once every 2 weeks. Burst of Steam & Vertical Steam: This function worked well for tough wrinkles and heavy fabrics, by pressing the burst of steam button. And it can also be applied when holding the iron in the vertical position as Vertical Steam Spraying Methods: You can add moisture to the clothing/fabric that you are ironing at any time by pressing the Spray Button a few times. Other Features: Super hot 1800w power, large capacity 350ml water tank, 8.5ft 360°swivel cord Specification: Model: HL-8001 Power: 1800W Voltage: 120V Tank Capacity: 350ml Cord Length: 2.6m / 8.5ft Weight: 1.390kg / 3.06lb Dimension: 31*12.8*15cm /12.2”*5.04”*5.91” Package Includes: 1 x MARTISAN IRON  1 x Filling Cup 1 x User Manual Tips: It’s normal for new irons to have drops of water present in the water tank. These water drops are present due to the function testing of every iron by the manufacturer before going to market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iW5-lfUgL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTISAN","source_asin":"B07SWB3ZMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SWB3ZMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SWB3ZMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
