window.products.push({"id":827496,"name":"HealthPro Super Strong Lightweight Titanium (Ti) Dinner Plate, 7-Inch (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MXWhPmfxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Carrying a HealthPro 7\" Titanium Plate keeps you light on your feet. Now you have peace of mind knowing that your plate will be fine if rolls down a mountain or if if it gets banged around in your backpack. Keep your pack light and your travels far with lightweight cook ware from HealthPro. This meal ready plate is made from nearly weightless, super strong titanium to let you have what you need to better enjoy life on the trail. It features raised edges to reduce spillages and comes in its own mesh drawstring bag. Putting this featherweight plate in your pack, with other titanium cook ware, will let you carry everything that you need to make a complete meal without slowing down your travels.The HealthPro \"7 Titanium plate is great for everyday home use also. HealthPro knows the frustration of having to throw away broken or chipped plates after just a few uses. They set out to design a new kind of plate that is not only beautiful, but unbreakable and super cool. The next time you eat, use a titanium plate. They are lightweight and will also last and last. They are dishwasher safe and designed to withstand hundreds of uses. Unlike typical dishware, these 7 inch high rimed plates wont crack, warp or break.And we have more reasons why you need a Titanium plate. First, titanium is tasteless and odorless, which means it won't affect your foods taste. Also, it has very low thermal conductivity, which means your Titanium plate will resist getting too cold or too hot (depending on your food of choice). Titanium is also super strong and light weight, which means it will not chip or break. Finally, you need a Titanium plate because it is awesome. And you are awesome, too - the perfect match!Specifications~Material: food grade 100% titanium~Dishwasher safe: Yes~Quantity: 1 plates~Length: 7\"~Height: 1.5\"~Weight: 2.4 oz","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MXWhPmfxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProHealth","source_asin":"B00MPSFJ7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MPSFJ7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MPSFJ7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
