window.products.push({"id":827512,"name":"Silicone Baking Mats Set, CHOOBY Kitchen Kneading Dough Mat with Measurement, Food Safe Oven Liners for Making Cookies Pastry Macaron Bread Pizza Pie,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pBwckkj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multi-combination Set]】CHOOBY silicone have 4 pices： 2 x Half-Sheet Size Baking Mats (16 1/2” x 11 1/2”) 1 x Quarter-Sheet Size Cooking Mat (11 1/2” x 8 1/2”) 1 x Round Size Cake/pizza Pan Mat (9\" Dia) - Mat thickness is 0.7mm (approx. 1/32\"). Perfect for baking, kneading, rolling, candy/macaron/pastry/cookie/bun/bread /pizza. 【More Than Double Thickness】 The thickness of the Mat is 0.7MM, which is more than twice that of other mats (0.3MM), durable and lasting, thicker mats will not slip and wrinkle when used, so it is very hard to crinkle and move as you roll out the dough, pastry mat is also hard to crinkle as you clean . 【Non-stick & Easy To Clean】 The surface of our silicone mats are non-sticky, and no food will stick to the pad. Simply use the dishwasher or rinse the silicone pad in warm soapy water to clean it. You don't need to clean the traditional bakeware as before, saving time and money. 【Durable & Reusable】 Our baking mat can be safely baked in the oven at a harsh temperature of up to 482 degrees. The microwave, oven and freezer are all safe to use, and the smell will not penetrate the baking mat. Everything is cooked evenly without uneven browning. 【Warmming Detials】 Half Oven Liner , printed with measurementsin metric,to help make dough at any size you want. Pastry mat is printed with evenly spaced isometric cookie, cake circles that clearly guide you in where to place your cookie dough, making it easier to make and display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pBwckkj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHOOBY","source_asin":"B08NF2PJN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NF2PJN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NF2PJN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
