window.products.push({"id":827706,"name":"Parve Green Slotted Skimmer Spoon – Non Stick Silicone - Strainer For Soups, Stews, Gravy and Hot and Cold Foods – Comfortable Handle – Color Coded Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rr6m5NnhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen kosher while using the highest quality kitchen accessories with The Kosher Cook! Make meals a lot more appetizing for you and the family with our professional slotted skimmer spoon that easily separates hot oil and water from your cooked dishes. It’s a safe way to serve food to make sure there aren’t any boiled spots left in a bit that can potentially cause severe harm when biting into. A comfortable ergonomic grip makes utilizing it super easy and without any trouble. Make meals tastier and safer for everyone to enjoy. PRODUCT FEATURES Professional Grip Slotted Skimming Spoon  Comfortable Handle Grip  Perfect Soups, Stews, Meats, Wontons, and More Easy to Clean Color Separated for Kosher Household: - Blue for Dairy (Milchik)- Red for Meat (Fleishik)- Green For Parve Creating delicious dishes in the comfort of your home is a breeze with our skimming spoon! Remove excess moisture from your meals easily and efficiently so that every bite is healthier, tastier, and safer. It’s great for French fries, wontons, stewed meats, and a bunch of other foods that can get too oily or water while cooking. KEEPING IT KOSHER The Kosher Cook provides a wide array of tools to help separate milchig, fleishig and parev. Color coded products and tools along with labels and stickers allow you to see at a glance if the item is dairy, meat or pareve. Whether you are new to keeping kashrut or a seasoned veteran looking to make life easier, the Kosher Cook has the tools to keep the highest standards of kosher cooking. About The Kosher Cook Part of the Ner Mitzvah family, The Kosher Cook is another way we to help you keep Jewish traditions and laws. Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert maker of household products and the premier source for traditional and gift Judaica items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rr6m5NnhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kosher Cook","source_asin":"B07P6D8DB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P6D8DB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P6D8DB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
