window.products.push({"id":827840,"name":"Minos Moka Pot Espresso Maker - 6 cups - 10 fl oz - Stainless Steel And Heatproof Handle - Suitable for Gas, Electric And Ceramic Stovetops","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g7LgCBHcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"If you’re a true coffee lover and are looking for a truly authentic, romantic and delicious cup of coffee, this will be the best thing you’ll read about today. Brewing coffee with a Moka Pot, designed and first released in 1933, is still considered the world’s most authentic way to brew a strong, delicious cup of coffee. Today’s Moka Pots still have the same classic look to it, but we’re proud to tell you that we’ve practically “upgraded” the way people brew coffee from Moka Pots. Introducing the Minos Moka Pot. Designed with heavy stainless steel, it is created to last. Stainless steel is much stronger, and can stand intense heat more than aluminum (which is what most Moka Pots are made of), giving it a much longer “lifetime” than other brands. We also gave the classic look an update with a more sleek, modern and upscale feel. And because of the new design, it is much easier to clean up. Using The Minos Moka Pot to brew a delicious cup of coffee is an art, and can become your daily morning ritual or meditation that rewards you with a strong wake-me-up. It is very simple and easy to use, and was made for coffee lovers and enthusiasts of all kinds. The diameter of the base is 3.2 inches. We recommend brewing your espresso/coffee using Minos Moka Pot on a 15*15 induction stove. The Minos Moka Pot comes in 4-cup and 6-cup sizes. It can perfectly suit your using scenario. Just choose your right one. Experience a truly romantic and authentic cup of delicious Italian-style coffee with the Minos Moka Pot. Get yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g7LgCBHcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Minos","source_asin":"B01MTYEKXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTYEKXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTYEKXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":827841,"name":"A-10 Thunderbolt/Warthog Flying Dirty 8x10 Silver Halide Photo Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313-kAxIrFL._AC_.jpg","description":"This museum grade traditional silver halide photograph is MADE IN THE USA directly from The McMahan Photo Archive's copyrighted full resolution restored originals.PHOTO DESCRIPTIONPhoto of a U.S. Air Force A-10 Thunderbolt II / Warthog with landing gear down. The A-10 was the first military aircraft designed solely for close air supportPHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Copyright, The McMahan Photo Archive/RMP Archive/Richard Seaman PHOTO IMAGE DATE: September 18, 2004IMAGE ID: RS027ABOUT OUR PHOTOGRAPHSThe McMahan Photo Archive mixes the best of today's print and restoration technologies with old fashioned hard work and artistry. People make the artistic decisions, not computers. We have printed over a million real light exposed and chemical processed silver halide prints since our start in 2001. What you are buying here is a REAL PHOTOGRAPH! At The McMahan Photo Art Gallery & Archive, you are always buying the best!Every order is backed by our 365 Day 100% RAVING FAN GUARANTEE! If your print isn't perfect, we will make it right or accept a return for a full refund. We really want you to be one of our raving fans!Robert McMahanFounder, Photographer, Historic Photo Print Expert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313-kAxIrFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The McMahan Photo Archive","source_asin":"B004G3C1EU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-827841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004G3C1EU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004G3C1EU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
